    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJerubali, onguGidiyoni, labo bonke ababelaye bavuka ekuseni, bamisa ngasemthonjeni waseHarodi, izihonqo zamaMidiyani zazisenyakatho kwabo, phansi kwentaba yaseMore esigodini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuGidiyoni: Abantu olabo banengi kakhulu ukuba nginikele amaMidiyani ezandleni zabo, funa abakoIsrayeli bazikhukhumeze kimi bathi: Sizinqobele thina ngamandla ethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokhoke memezela lokhu ebantwini uthi: Lowo owesabayo lothuthumelayo kasuke entabeni yaseGilibowa, abuyele ekhaya. Ngakho, abazinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lambili babuyela ekhaya, kwasala inkulungwane ezilitshumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.20.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 20:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuGidiyoni: Abantu basesebanengi kakhulu; bathathe ubase emanzini, ngizakukuhlolela bona khona; lowo engizakuthi ngaye kuwe: Lumuntu uzahamba lawe; uzahamba lawe; lalowo engizakuthi ngaye kuwe: Lumuntu kayikuhamba lawe; angahambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebesake abantu ngasemanzini. INkosi yathi kuGidiyoni: Bonke abaxhapha amanzi njengenja, uzababeka bodwa; ngokunjalo labo bonke abaguqayo ukuba banathe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubunengi balabo abaxhaphayo babengamakhulu amathathu; abanye bonke baguqa ngamadolo ukunatha benatha ngezandla zabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuGidiyoni: Ngamakhulu amathathu alabo axhaphileyo ngizakulikhulula, nginikele amaMidiyani ezandleni zakho; bayekele bonke abanye babuyele emakhaya abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uGidiyoni wasebabuyisela bonke abakoIsrayeli emakhaya, kwasala amakhulu amathathu, bathatha inqayi lempondo zokukhaliswa abantu ababelazo. Izihonqo zamaMidiyani zazingaphansi esigodini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalobobusuku iNkosi yathi kuye: Suka, wehle uyehlasela izihonqo, ngoba ngizinikele ezandleni zakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba usesaba ukwehla uye ezihonqweni, hamba loPura inceku yakho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uzwe abakukhulumayo; kuzakukunika isibindi sokuba uzihlasele izihonqo. Wasesehla loPura inceku yakhe, waya emaphethelweni ezihonqo lapho kwakukhona abahlomileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AmaMidiyani lamaAmaleki labo bonke abantu basempumalanga babelele kuso sonke isigodi bebanengi njengentethe, lamakamela abo ayengelakubalwa engangetshebetshebe elisokhunjini lolwandle ubunengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uGidiyoni efika, wafica umuntu elandisela umngane wakhe iphupho esithi: Ngiphuphe ngibona isinkwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " siphoseka ezihonqweni zamaMidiyani, safika ethenteni, salitshaya saligenqula, lawela phansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umngane wakhe wathi: Lokhu kutsho kuphela umhedla kaGidiyoni indodana kaJowashi, owakoIsrayeli. UNkulunkulu unikele esandleni sakhe lonke iMidiyani lempi yalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uGidiyoni esizwa ukulandiswa kwephupho lencazelo yalo, wakhuleka, wasebuyela ezihonqweni zakoIsrayeli, wathi: Vukani, ngoba iNkosi inikele impi yamaMidiyani ezandleni zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesahlukanisa abantu abangamakhulu amathathu, baba yizigaba ezintathu, wabanika impondo zokukhaliswa, lenqayi ezingelalutho, wafaka izibane phakathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kubo: Khangelani lapha, lingilingise. Nxa ngifika emaphethelweni ezihonqo, lenze njengami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nxa mina labo bonke abangakimi sikhalisa impondo, lani lonke elihanqe izihonqo lizakhalisa impondo zenu, limemeze lithi: OweNkosi lokaGidiyoni!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UGidiyoni labantu abalikhulu ababengakuye bafika emaphethelweni ezihonqo ekuqaleni komlindo waphakathi, sebeqalisile ukulinda; bakhalisa impondo, babulala izinqayi ababeziphethe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababesezigabeni ezintathu bakhalisa impondo, babulala izinqayi, bephethe ezandleni zabo zasekhohlo izibane lezandleni zabo zokunene impondo zokukhaliswa, bamemeza besithi: Umkhonto weNkosi lokaGidiyoni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke bema endaweni zabo bezihanqile izihonqo, lempi yonke yavuka itshaywa luvalo, yabaleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho abangamakhulu amathathu bekhalisa impondo zabo, ezihonqweni zonke iNkosi yenza bonke abantu balwe labaseduze labo; impi yabaleka yaze yafika eBeti‐Shita ngaseZerera, lasemqolweni waseAbeli‐Mehola phansi kweTabathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli babizwa koNafitali lakoAsheri lakoManase wonke, baxotshana lamaMidiyani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UGidiyoni wathuma izithunywa kuzo zonke intaba zakoEfrayimi wathi: Wozani kulwa lamaMidiyani, livimbe emazibukweni eJordani lize lifike eBeti‐Bara. Ngakho bonke abakoEfrayimi babizwa, bavimba emazibukweni eJordani baze bafika eBeti‐Bara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathumba amakhosana amabili aseMidiyani, uOrebi loZeba; uOrebi bambulalela edwaleni laseOrebi, uZeba bambulalela esikhamelweni saseZeba, bexotshana lamaMidiyani. Baletha amakhanda aboOrebi loZeba kuGidiyoni ngaphetsheya kweJordani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
